OL,3,GNEWSA'My daughter was murdered, never
OL,4,Aleave your friends'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a student who was
OL,7,Fmurdered on her way home from a night
OL,8,Fout has encouraged pupils to stay
OL,9,Ftogether at university.
OL,11,FLibby Squire, 21, was raped and
OL,12,Fmurdered by Pawel Relowicz in January
OL,13,F2019. Her killer was found to have
OL,14,Fprevious convictions for voyeurism and
OL,15,Fpublic sex acts.
OL,17,FLibby's mother Lisa Squire has spent
OL,18,Fthe past five years trying to increase
OL,19,Fthe reporting of non-contact sexual
OL,20,Foffences, launching the It Does Matter
OL,21,Fcampaign in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
