OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1791906974
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'My daughter was murdered, never
OL,4,Aleave your friends'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLisa gave a talk to pupils at Newent
OL,7,FCommunity School, in Gloucestershire,
OL,8,Fon Monday and said her aim was to tell
OL,9,Fpupils considering university to have
OL,10,F"the time of your life but do it
OL,11,Fsafely". She said: "Never leave your
OL,12,Ffriends on their own."
